# Legacy npm/pnpm settings file.
#
# IMPORTANT: pnpm 11 does NOT read this file for its own settings. It reads
# them from pnpm-workspace.yaml, which is where `nodeLinker: hoisted` and the
# build-script approvals now live.
#
# `node-linker=hoisted` used to live here and was silently ignored — the repo
# was building against a symlinked node_modules that electron-builder cannot
# package. Verify with `pnpm config get node-linker` after any change: it must
# print `hoisted`, not `undefined`.
#
# Left in place so older pnpm versions still resolve the same layout.